      "content": "i just feel so disconnected from everything. everything here is just noise. it feels like im stuck in this half-life while he's actually somewhere peaceful. sometimes i wonder if i'm even meant to be here without him. it's like we were one person and now the part that actually matters is just... gone. i'm just a shadow.",
